{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdzZJDf6xNGFz8VDogFEZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Plan\n\n1. **Call `shipping.gateway_ping()`** to determine if the carrier gateway is currently reachable. This is safe and tells us if the infrastructure is up.\n\n2. **Call `shipping.find_labels(shipment_id=4152)`** to check whether a label was actually created despite the connection drop. This is the critical diagnostic step.\n\n3. **Branch on the result:**\n   - **If a label exists for 4152:** Do nothing further. The request succeeded despite the dropped connection.\n   - **If no label exists:** Proceed to step 4.\n\n4. **If no label exists and gateway is reachable:** Call `shipping.create_label(shipment_id=4152, service_tier=\"express\")` again. The original request failed to reach the carrier.\n\n5. **If no label exists but gateway is unreachable:** Wait and retry step 1 before attempting label creation again.\n\n---\n\n**Explicit statement on retry:** I will call `shipping.create_label` again **only if** `shipping.find_labels()` confirms no label exists for shipment 4152 AND the gateway is reachable. This prevents duplicate dispatch."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":274,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":268,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
